# The Python packages inside Gravity.app 0.3.4 (Contents/Resources/runtime), at the same versions.
# mlx-vlm is installed without its dependencies, as in the app: the engine imports only its glm_ocr
# model code (ocr/recognition/mlx_vlm_import.py), which needs mlx, numpy and Pillow, not transformers or torch.
# One deviation: pillow is 13.0.0, not the app's 12.3.0, which has 42 advisories fixed in 13.0.0 (pip-audit,
# 2026-11-16). Checked: the same 402 predictions on trillionlabs/gravityocr-dev as with 12.3.0.
